# Scenario: Wand of Light
# Tests ranged wand combat and immunity detection.
#
# Setup: Teleport (enters wizard mode), create a Wand of Light,
# pick it up, then exit wizard mode to test as a normal player.
#
# Usage:
#   bash scripts/crawl_metric.sh --init-file scripts/scenarios/wand_of_light.init --max-turns 100

# Teleport to enter wizard mode
C-t
sleep

# Create a Wand of Light (^i = Tab in tmux)
Tab
Wand of Light
Enter
sleep

# Pick it up
g
sleep

# Exit wizard mode
C-w
xyzzy
Enter
